<title>HUNGARY: Hungary prelim Feb ind. output up 3.1 pct mo/mo.</title>
<headline>Hungary prelim Feb ind. output up 3.1 pct mo/mo.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's industrial output in February rose 3.1 percent over January and was 7.8 percent above February 1996, according to preliminary figures released by the Central Statistical Office (KSH) on Thursday.</p>
<p>In the first two months of the year the accumulative industrial output was 7.1 percent above the same two months of 1996, it said.  </p>
<p>HUNGARY INDUSTRY OUTPUT</p>
<p>   (Pct)			Feb 97  Jan 97    Feb 96</p>
<p>  Month-on-month change  +3.1	+11.0     n.a</p>
<p>  Year-on-year change    +7.8	+ 6.4    +4.4</p>
<p>NOTE - KSH said detailed figures will be available in two weeks' time. -- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
